WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.720
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.190
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.330
Utau is having a concert today!

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.520
We thank everyone very, very much for their support!

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.480
She put her heart into her songs for all you jerks out there!

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.870
Il, how dare you refer to her fans as jerks!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.190
Shut up, El!

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.140
It's been a while since we had a good fight.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.870
If the three of us aren't here...

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.070
...by the end...

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.600
That would be awful, right?

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.000
Doki!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.180
If you were to walk so the wind fluttered the edge of your cape,

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:50.570
people would look up at you in quiet admiration.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:57.870
You can say spicy things like "it's not my style," if you want,

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:04.290
but I know who you really are because I'm your friend!

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.160
Stand! Bow! {these are the two things said by the class rep when the teacher enters at the start of the school day}

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.690
Nice and orderly now!

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:11.530
And once that's done,

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:16.800
it's time to start the school day.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:24.420
I like Mondays because I can see all my friends.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:30.820
There's nothing wrong with being abnormally happy.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:37.990
At lunch break, we have tea in the Royal Garden,

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:45.330
where I tell you all my secrets!

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.340
Out Searching for Ikuto

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.160
Look! Amu-chan's patented milk-jug gulp!

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:05.890
It's quickly becoming a standard! {as in, an old standby, like the songs that rock bands always play every concert}

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:06.430
Even though she's-

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.480
Even though she's the heroine!

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.150
That's my line!

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.900
Don't mind us!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.830
Il, El, what brings you here so late?

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.040
Utau asked us to.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.460
She did?

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:21.780
Ah, her new song is coming out soon, right?

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:23.390
Yes!

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:23.780
Ta-da!

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:28.680
And she's holding a concert to commemorate its release!

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.090
Feel free to come, if you'd like.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:32.850
Is what she said.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:35.170
She tries <i>so</i> hard to act indifferent.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:38.510
This is Utau's first big concert in a while.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.180
You'll totally go, right?

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:41.430
Of course!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:46.220
Yeah! And since we're going, we've gotta help make her concert awesome!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.600
That would be nice.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.850
I call it:

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:54.940
The "Since We're Going We've Gotta Make Her Concert Awesome Plan!"

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.140
Yay!

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.240
Uh, you didn't change anything...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:03.200
Episode 93
Hoshina Utau, Fly to the Future!

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:11.370
We've finally made it.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:16.630
Today's concert marks a new starting line for you, Utau.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.800
No, for both of us. Isn't that right?

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:29.140
The rehearsal is beginning!

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.400
What's that?

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.740
We're kickin' it off for Hoshina Utau! {this is a bit hard... what I put is not that literal. lit: "Right now Hoshina Utau is venturing forth" ... shutsujin literally means "heading to the battlefield", however it is used for a number of circumstances like "starting an election campaign" or "take the field" (as in a sports team)... but it's also commonly used with the kanji "shiki" to mean "kick-off party"... I'm not sure keeping it sounding "samurai"-ish helps at all here for comprehension}

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.200
Check out Hoshina Utau's Concert!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:47.230
Everyone, please come see Hoshina Utau's concert!

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:51.370
We're kickin' it off for Hoshina Utau!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.270
Why am I the only one in this outfit?

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:58.210
When you want to gather an audience, it's important to get their attention first.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.170
That's right!

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.270
But no one is gathering...

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:04.520
That's because the concert is tonight.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.220
We must be too early.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.970
What are you guys doing?

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:10.650
Sanjo-san...

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:12.480
Well, you see...

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:16.710
These guys are trying to get people excited about the concert.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.710
We are very, very thankful!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.830
Hey, we're doing a rehearsal right now. Want to watch?

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.200
Even if you feel you're being crushed by sadness,

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.670
please don't make face.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:46.960
Just throw away that cheap pride you wear!

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.650
Utau-chan is so wonderful!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:56.100
She said this new song is for the fans who've stuck with her through thick and thin.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.840
That's cool!

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:05.730
Please help make today's concert a success!

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:08.910
We really went through a lot to get here.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:13.770
We had to start from square one after being kicked out of Easter.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:16.870
But the two of them worked hard, and we've finally come all this way!

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:18.910
I see...

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:21.980
Of course, the two of us feel the same way.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:22.960
Of course!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:33.870
Perhaps Utau-chan wants this concert to be a success to repay Sanjo-san for all she's done for her.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:34.690
Yeah...

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:40.520
Utau!

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:43.190
You sounded great. {the usual "good work" seems to condescending in this context...}

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.250
Why are you here? You must have a lot of free time.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.810
Uh, didn't you invite me?!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.940
I thought you'd be busy with other things.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:52.620
With Ikuto, for instance.

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:55.450
What's going on?

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:59.880
I trusted you, but I haven't heard a single thing from you about him!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.440
Uh, well, that's because...

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:07.380
She gets a bit worked up before a big concert. Please forgive her.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.090
Utau, the rehearsal is starting again!

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:13.310
Utau!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.650
Do your best at the concert, okay?

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:20.980
It's only natural that I'd do my best.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:25.080
Songs belong to every fan who listens to them.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:28.900
It's because of all the fans who've supported me that I can sing.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:31.160
Utau...

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:37.410
I'll be cheering for your concert to be a success, too!

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.120
You really have too much free time.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.670
Of course! We're friends!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.830
Fine...

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.330
Everyone ready?

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.740
Come Here Embryo Mk. III!

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:08.290
This time, the sound will extend over a much wider circumference!

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.320
Let the experiment begin!

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.030
Right!

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.450
I'm sure looking forward to her concert.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.160
Yeah.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:26.680
Huh?

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.950
What's the matter? The sound stopped.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:30.830
It seems to have broken down.

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:32.030
Figure out why, now!

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:33.470
Yessir!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.990
That sound...

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:37.640
It sounded like Tsukiyomi Ikuto's violin.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:40.900
Has he come to see Utau-chan's concert?

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:42.730
I doubt it.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:47.150
Still, it might be better to keep this from Utau-chan.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:50.640
If she knew about Ikuto's situation...

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.070
She'd probably call the concert off.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:57.030
We have to do something before Utau notices.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:57.940
Yeah.

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:01.250
I heard that!

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:04.260
You guys are tryin' to hide something from Utau?

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.830
No, not exactly...

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.590
Um! Well! You see! Uh!

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.280
Please keep this a secret from Utau for now.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.760
We'll tell her everything once the concert's over.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:19.250
I want today to be a success, no matter what!

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.520
Which means, we have to let her focus on her concert!

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:27.480
Fine, then. I'll keep quiet.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.150
Thank you!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:33.260
When it comes to hiding things, El says, "No!" {I like keeping the 3rd person for this line, it actually sounds more natural to me}

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:37.700
It flies in the face of my motto of freedom!

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:41.450
But we need your help, Pretty Angel!

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:42.170
Doki!

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.670
Love!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:46.130
El's lips are sealed!

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:48.750
She fell in a flash.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.670
What are you guys doing?

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.320
Utau! Shouldn't you be rehearsing?!

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.780
It's over already.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.270
Is that so?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:01.900
And I came just as she was heading out to clear her head.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:07.500
But Kukai, I'm surprised you knew about Utau-chan's concert today.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.650
Oh, yeah. She mentioned it the last time we were together.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.330
The two of you were <i>together</i>?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.460
Suspicious...

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:20.680
Actually, I've noticed for a while that...

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:21.160
Huh?

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:25.060
Amu, are you hiding something from me?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.480
Can't get anything past Utau...

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.420
It's about Ikuto, isn't it?

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:39.490
No way! I'd never hide things from my friends!

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.640
We were just talking about tomorrow's Guardian Meeting agenda...

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:47.270
Fine, whatever. It's about time I headed back.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:48.210
Sure. {fix timing, stays on way too long}

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.320
So it is about Tsukiyomi Ikuto...

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:58.800
Yeah.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:04.210
Amu-chan, we don't have a choice, we can't tell Utau-chan right now.

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:06.040
I know that, but...

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.830
I can't wait!

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:14.210
It's been so long since Utau-chan's had a concert!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.470
And I hear she'll be singing a new song!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.610
Really?

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:24.060
It's because of all the fans who've supported me that I can sing.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.640
You heard what she said.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:29.650
We've just got to make this concert a success!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.670
Let's go, Amu-chan.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:34.770
We'll figure out what caused that violin sound earlier.

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:37.370
Let's solve this problem ourselves.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.410
And before the concert starts, right?

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.040
Yeah!

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:02.190
There doesn't seem to be anything wrong with it...

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.650
I've got it!

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:09.970
The Mk. III's generator doesn't have enough power.

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:12.400
Is that what it needs?

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.570
But where would we find that kind of power around here?

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.740
I'm really looking forward to her concert.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:20.220
I wonder what she'll be wearing!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:22.810
Concert?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.730
They should be letting people in by now.

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.410
Something the matter?

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.540
No, nothing.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.050
Come in.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:39.760
Hey.

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:41.140
Yuu?

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.180
Why are you here?

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:45.890
Hinamori-san told me you're having a concert.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.770
I figured I should chaperon them on their way home.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.790
Oh? Haven't you become a fine teacher.

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.810
So where are the kids?

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:58.450
Oh, they said they had something to check out and looked kind of busy.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.840
Anyway...

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:07.330
Congratulations on another big concert.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.330
Thank you...

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.550
I can't believe it's Hoshina Utau's concert...

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:40.690
It's pretty impressive how she's climbed back up after falling so low.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:41.950
Preparations complete!

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.310
So then, shall we?

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.320
Yes!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.790
Come Here Embryo!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.210
It's that violin sound again!

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.030
Buy me something to drink...

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.180
What?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.360
N-Nothing!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.800
It's nothing at all!

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.280
Really?

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:16.810
El.

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:22.090
Got it. I'll investigate.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.780
This is...

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:33.240
Big trouble!

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:34.710
El!

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.430
Whoa, look at all these X Eggs!

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.280
They came from Utau-chan's fans!

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:41.550
Utau's fans?

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.940
Amu-chan, the sound is coming from over there.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:47.550
So it's not Ikuto?

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.310
What should we do now?

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.670
Report to the Director!

00:13:55.670 --> 00:14:00.050
"This time... there were... no incidents..."

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:01.070
Bye-onara! {they actually say "bainara" which is a combination of "bye" and "sayonara"... since "sayonara" is known in english I'll just keep the joke as is}

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.380
I've got to let Utau-chan know.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:05.570
Wait, the concert's about to start.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:06.780
But!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.490
Let us handle this.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.780
Yeah!

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:21.280
My heart: {yeah, I'm cheating and just making this one line :) }

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:22.710
Unlock!

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:43.070
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.640
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:49.990
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:54.080
Character Transformation: Beat Jumper!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.500
Character Transformation: Sky Jack!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.690
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:25.770
Blaze Shoot! {Yeah, unfortunately we have "Golden Victory Shoot" so this should probably stay Engrished too. hmm, when it comes to horrible engrish attack names we've just been keeping them as said, right? I kindof want to say "Blazing Shot" instead, but...}

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.650
The X Eggs are working together?

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.470
Holy Crown!

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:47.110
These X Eggs...

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.510
...are really good at teamwork!

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:51.290
But if it's teamwork you want...

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.300
We can do that, too!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.350
Tightrope Dancer!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:58.140
Go Go Little Duckies!

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.970
My duckies!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:11.650
I think Utau-chan is the only one who can stop them!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.700
What's taking El so darn long?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.530
Il?

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.470
You know something, don't you?

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:28.750
All set, Utau?

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.630
Let's make sure today's concert is a hit!

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:32.840
Utau-chan!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:33.730
El?

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:37.360
It's just awful! A bunch of X Eggs are attacking Amu-chan and the others!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.100
X Eggs?

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.080
Hey, stop it! Utau has her concert to...

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:41.850
But!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.240
Cut it out!

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:48.860
Didn't Amu say herself that she was gonna make this concert a success?

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.610
That's why we said we'd keep quiet!

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:57.930
So Amu hid the X Eggs from me...

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:00.830
But where did they all come from?

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:06.070
Well, from the fans who came to see your concert...

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.500
They belong to my fans?

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:18.580
Utau.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.930
There's only five minutes left until the concert starts.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:28.470
Utau...

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:29.940
Utau-chan!

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:35.280
But that should be plenty of time for you, right?

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.120
Sanjo-san...

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:06.640
Utau!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.980
Utau, what about your concert?

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:15.030
Honestly, do I have to do everything around here? {lit: "don't cause me trouble"}

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.030
Utau!

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:24.830
Angel Cradle!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:40.650
It's like they're all happily listening to Utau-chan's song.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:45.710
That's 'cause the owners of these X Eggs are her fans!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:48.540
It's also why they had such good teamwork.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:52.480
And it's exactly why only Utau-chan could save them.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.540
Thank you, Utau.

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.500
I'd like you to stop hiding things from me.

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:18.420
Sorry.

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:27.690
Um...

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.500
Amu.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:33.440
I trust you. We're friends, after all.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:36.780
Utau!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.870
Where's Utau-chan?

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:55.710
She's not in her dressing room...

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.980
This isn't good. I hope she's not in trouble.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.080
At this rate...

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:01.410
Be quiet a sec.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.720
Sorry!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:06.280
Thanks for waiting.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.180
We made it...

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.510
Utau.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.440
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.590
Yes.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:33.600
Even if you feel you're being crushed by sadness,

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.920
please don't make that face.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:44.250
Just throw away that cheap pride you wear!

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:50.770
Keep on living under the sunlight. Don't look away.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:54.980
Yeah, I can feel it, when you're honest with yourself,

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:59.230
you want to smile, to laugh our loud! Glorious happiness! {note, Glorious Sunshine is the official name of the song, so don't change "glorious"}

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:01.420
Utau-chan is just wonderful!

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:05.860
You'll never give up. You won't give in to anyone. You have a dream! {she'll never give up, or she's telling Amu not to give up, if she's singing "to" her?}

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:03.530
Well, duh!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.120
Nice song, don't you think, Amu-chan?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.370
I want to tell you! I want you to seize it!

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:07.050
Yeah.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:12.030
Okay! Time for part two of the "Make Her Concert Awesome Plan!"

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:12.040
Take a deep breath. Don't rush.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:19.670
Show me your wonderful smile, bright as the sun!

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:25.340
Glorious sunshine!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:31.620
Keep on living under the sunlight. Don't look away.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:37.980
That way, even a goddess would be jealous of your passionate kiss.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.230
Brilliant happiness!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:46.280
There's an unwavering light piercing your heart.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:49.560
Not bad. Same goes for the kids.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:53.040
You, and only you, can find the true meaning of that radiance.

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:53.040
Yes. It's an amazing show.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:22:02.610
Sing a song of thanks, bright as the sun!

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.300
I wish Ikuto could hear this.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:09.930
I'm sure he will someday.

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:33.220
You sure do seem determined.

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:39.270
So even if you screw up, it'll somehow turn out all right.

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:46.640
How about you just trust in yourself?

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:53.100
Take that first step and everything will work out fine.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:23:00.030
Even if people see through your cool exterior, keep marching on.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:09.110
Look up at the blue sky and everything will reset!

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.750
Take it easy! Take it easy! {the first is in English, the second is in Japanese (but that is the exact same meaning)}

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:23.290
Try to relax those shoulders and clear your mind.

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:30.000
The more you do it, the easier it'll get, so keep taking it easy.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:35.200
Ride the flow of time and you'll be...

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.000
Shining! Shining! Shining!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:53.660
Today's preview will be brought to you in kitty-talk!

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:55.410
Hope you enjoy it!

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:57.520
Huh? Kitty-talk?

00:23:58.650 --> 00:23:59.910
Su?

00:24:01.280 --> 00:24:02.280
Ran?

00:24:03.560 --> 00:24:04.960
Miki, too?

00:24:05.890 --> 00:24:08.160
Enough! I don't understand you!

00:24:08.160 --> 00:24:10.130
Stop it!

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.370
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.370 --> 00:24:14.430
Onward! The Calico Cat Search Party!?

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:16.630
Now, Amu-chan, in kitty-talk!

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:19.450
No way! Don't make me do it!
